    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"CustomRepositoryImplementationDetector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>CustomRepositoryImplementationDetector</code></a> with the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>,\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a> and <a href=\"ImplementationDetectionConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>ImplementationDetectionConfiguration</code></a>. The latter will be registered for a\none-time component scan for implementation candidates that will the be used and filtered in all subsequent calls to\n<a href=\"#detectCustomImplementation(org.springframework.data.repository.config.ImplementationLookupConfiguration)\"><code>detectCustomImplementation(ImplementationLookupConfiguration)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个使用给定的 <a href=\"CustomRepositoryImplementationDetector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>CustomRepositoryImplementationDetector</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a> 和 <a href=\"ImplementationDetectionConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>ImplementationDetectionConfiguration</code></a> 的新实例。后者将注册用于对实现候选者执行一次性组件扫描，这些候选者将在后续所有调用 <a href=\"#detectCustomImplementation(org.springframework.data.repository.config.ImplementationLookupConfiguration)\"><code>detectCustomImplementation(ImplementationLookupConfiguration)</code></a> 时被使用并过滤。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Detects the custom implementation for a <a href=\"../Repository.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>Repository</code></a> instance. If\nconfigured with a <a href=\"ImplementationDetectionConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>ImplementationDetectionConfiguration</code></a> at construction time, the necessary component scan is\nexecuted on first access, cached and its result is the filtered on every further implementation lookup according to\nthe given <a href=\"ImplementationDetectionConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>ImplementationDetectionConfiguration</code></a>. If none is given initially, every invocation to\n<a href=\"#detectCustomImplementation(org.springframework.data.repository.config.ImplementationLookupConfiguration)\"><code>detectCustomImplementation(ImplementationLookupConfiguration)</code></a> will issue a new component scan.",
      "translation": "检测 <a href=\"../Repository.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository 中的接口\"><code>Repository</code></a> 实例的自定义实现。如果在构造时配置了 <a href=\"ImplementationDetectionConfiguration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.config 中的接口\"><code>ImplementationDetectionConfiguration</code></a>，则在首次访问时执行必要的组件扫描，缓存其结果，并根据给定的 <a href=\"ImplementationDetectionConfiguration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.config 中的接口\"><code>ImplementationDetectionConfiguration</code></a> 对后续的每次实现查找进行过滤。如果初始未提供配置，则每次调用 <a href=\"#detectCustomImplementation(org.springframework.data.repository.config.ImplementationLookupConfiguration)\"><code>detectCustomImplementation(ImplementationLookupConfiguration)</code></a> 都会发起新的组件扫描。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"CustomRepositoryImplementationDetector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>CustomRepositoryImplementationDetector</code></a> with the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>,\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a> and <a href=\"ImplementationDetectionConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>ImplementationDetectionConfiguration</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个使用给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a>和<a href=\"ImplementationDetectionConfiguration.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>ImplementationDetectionConfiguration</code></a>来构建新的<a href=\"CustomRepositoryImplementationDetector.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.repository.config\"><code>CustomRepositoryImplementationDetector</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
